```

What will be the output of the following recursive Python function when called with `mystery(5)`?

```python
def mystery(n):
    if n <= 1:
        return 1
    return n * mystery(n - 2)

print(mystery(5))
```

What is the result of the following Java stream pipeline?

```java
List<Integer> list = Arrays.asList(1, 2, 3, 4, 5);
int sum = list.stream()
              .filter(n -> n % 2 == 0)
              .mapToInt(n -> n * n)
              .sum();
System.out.println(sum);
```

